    <data key="d0">Nimbos Cloud Automation Platform Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DkPPwq517aE</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture of an internal automation platform hosted on AWS, featuring Angular static asset delivery through CloudFront/WAF/S3, REST APIs on API Gateway leading to ECS Fargate microservices and RDS MySQL with read replicas, and a scheduled background processing loop via CloudWatch Events, Fargate daemon, and SQS queue.</data>
    <data key="d3">Web Applications, Serverless, Decoupled Architectures</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
